{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24623","headline":"履道西门二首 二 · 白居易","name":"履道西门二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"履道西门独掩扉，官休病退客来稀。\n亦知轩冕荣堪恋，其奈田园老合归。\n跛鼈难随骐骥足，伤禽莫趁凤凰飞。\n世间认得身人少，今我虽愚亦庶几。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24623.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24623","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}